    \item Out-of-range age raises \texttt{ValueError}
    \item Invalid Killip class raises \texttt{ValueError}
    \item Monotonicity: increasing age with everything else fixed increases the score
    \item Mortality lookup boundaries map to correct risk categories
\end{itemize}

